      },
      {
        "file": "../bili_001_collabo_ur_rip/gacha01.mtn"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nod01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-001.mp3",
        "text": "小豆泥，你刚才好厉害啊！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/smile03.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-002.mp3",
        "text": "要是我也能变得像小豆泥那么强就好了……\n咦，小豆泥？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/surprised01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-003.mp3",
        "text": "诶！你按了开始按钮！？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/surprised01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-004.mp3",
        "text": "哇！敌人出现了！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nnf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-005.mp3",
        "text": "直接冲过去很危险的~！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/serious02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-006.mp3",
        "text": "对了！给小豆泥加上BUFF就行了……！\n嘿！一定要生效啊~！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nf05.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-007.mp3",
        "text": "好厉害好厉害！\n敌人的攻击全躲开了！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-008.mp3",
        "text": "哇！\n小豆泥的抓挠攻击……！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/gattsu01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-009.mp3",
        "text": "真不愧是小豆泥！\n把敌人干掉了！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/surprised02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-010.mp3",
        "text": "哇哇！\n后面也有敌人！？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/angry01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-011.mp3",
        "text": "啊，小豆泥，危险！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nnf01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-012.mp3",
        "text": "好痛……咦？\n敌人已经倒下了"
      },
      {
        "file": "../bili_001_collabo_ur_rip/eeto01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-013.mp3",
        "text": "大概是因为我为了救小豆泥冲进去，\n所以让敌人打了个空吧……？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nf01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-014.mp3",
        "text": "虽然对于BUFF还不是很懂，\n但我也会帮你的，一起加油吧！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nod02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-015.mp3",
        "text": "小豆泥的头槌……！\n好响！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/smile06.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-016.mp3",
        "text": "哇，好像把敌人削弱了不少！\n谢谢！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/surprised01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-017.mp3",
        "text": "诶，还有吗~！？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nf04.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-018.mp3",
        "text": "呼~虽然挺难的，\n但能跟小豆泥一起作战，感觉特别开心！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nf05.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-019.mp3",
        "text": "我来加BUFF，小豆泥来攻击……"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/kime01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-020.mp3",
        "text": "说不定我们是最强搭档呢！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nnf04.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-021.mp3",
        "text": "敌人好像还有很多……\n那么！准备上吧~！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nod02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-022.mp3",
        "text": "小豆泥！冲呀——！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/surprised01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-023.mp3",
        "text": "哇，敌人超生气的！？\n小豆泥，危险！咦？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../bili_001_collabo_ur_rip/eeto01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-024.mp3",
        "text": "小豆泥在盯着远处看……\n……诶，睡着了！？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/surprised01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-025.mp3",
        "text": "怎、怎么办~！\n偏偏挑这个时候……"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/serious02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-026.mp3",
        "text": "可是，小豆泥都那么努力了，\n就算只有我一个人，也一定要干掉它！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nnf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-027.mp3",
        "text": "为了不吵醒小豆泥……\n尽量用最小幅度的动作，不发出声音……！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/angry01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-028.mp3",
        "text": "嘿~！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/jaan01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-029.mp3",
        "text": "太好啦~~！\n打倒了~~~！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/kime01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-030.mp3",
        "text": "这就是星星的力量~！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/nf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-031.mp3",
        "text": "啊，小豆泥，你醒啦~！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/gattsu01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-033.mp3",
        "text": "哇哇，刚睡醒的小豆泥\n很有精神呢！喵——！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../001_general_rip/smile01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res001003-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KM_01-034.mp3",
        "text": "多亏了小豆泥，我觉得自己变得好强！\n谢谢你！小豆泥！"
      }
    ],
